# 🗿🌎 GIANTBOUND ⚔️

## 🎮 Game Identity

GIANTBOUND is a Roblox multiplayer game built around one main identity mechanic: **extreme scale difference**.

One side controls a Giant, while the other side controls Tiny Players. The Giant can feel like a moving world/level, while Tiny Players navigate, climb, survive, use gadgets, and complete objectives around the Giant.

## 🏠 Shared Lobby & Custom Matches

Players gather in a shared lobby before entering matches. Players can create their own custom lobbies for free and choose match settings.

Current planned lobby limits:

- 👥 Total Players: up to 10
- 🗿 Giant Players: minimum 1, maximum 5
- 👤 Tiny Players: all remaining players automatically fill the Tiny side
- ⏱️ Match Time: minimum 10 minutes, maximum 2 hours
- 🎮 Mode: host-selected
- 🗺️ Map: host-selected
- ⚙️ Additional settings: expandable in the future

Players will also have a large customization system for personalizing their characters.

## 🎯 Core Vision

- 🗿 A Giant is a major part of the playable environment.
- 👤 Tiny Players must use their small size intelligently.
- ⚡ Both sides have different powers and abilities.
- 🪤 The Giant can place obstacles and traps to change the route.
- 🧗 Parkour and environmental movement are major parts of the experience.
- 🗺️ Maps and 🎮 modes are separate systems and can be reused together.
- 🧊 Classic Mode is built from the original Frozen Giant Showdown concept.
- 🔮 Future modes can introduce completely different objectives and rules.

## 🧊 Frozen Giant Showdown → GIANTBOUND

Frozen Giant Showdown is the **original gameplay concept created before GIANTBOUND**. Its mechanics are a major starting pool for GIANTBOUND rather than something to automatically discard.

Useful systems include:

- 🪤 Giant route-changing obstacles and powers
- 💰 Limited Giant resource spending
- 🧰 Temporary Tiny Player upgrades
- 🧗 Parkour hazards and moving traversal
- 🎁 Lucky temporary items
- ❤️ Short respawn after non-lethal falls
- 🌨️ Visibility/movement disruption
- 🔔 Counter-power ideas
- 💥 Cannon/objective gameplay for Classic Mode

## 🎮 Classic Mode

Classic Mode is the main mode intended to carry the full Frozen Giant Showdown gameplay concept into GIANTBOUND. Its original Giant objective, Tiny/Survivor objective, Giant HP, cannon damage, parkour, powers, upgrades, lucky items, and related systems will be discussed and integrated as a complete mode.

The exact implementation can be adapted to GIANTBOUND's broader systems without losing the original concept.

## 🧠 Design Principle

The Giant-vs-Tiny scale difference must remain the game's strongest identity. Supporting systems should strengthen that mechanic instead of becoming the main attraction.

